        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/bbce88/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-02T00:01:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You could rationalize it as the Sentinels team being so trusting of each other that when they damage/attack each other they're taken by surprise---no chance to defend themselves, so extra damage.</p>",
